04:39.177 --> 04:40.366
If I add another seven

04:40.366 --> 04:42.398
so this is plus 17.

04:42.398 --> 04:45.953
So this is plus 17 right over here.

04:45.953 --> 04:47.416
Plus 17.

04:47.416 --> 04:50.164
And so my change in Y over change in X.

04:50.164 --> 04:51.325
Change in Y

04:51.325 --> 04:52.992
over my change in X.

04:53.893 --> 04:56.289
For this secant line between

04:56.289 --> 04:57.918
when X is equaling three

04:57.918 --> 04:59.874
and X is equaling five

04:59.874 --> 05:02.943
is going to be equal to 17 over two.

05:02.943 --> 05:04.110
Seventeen over

05:05.984 --> 05:06.884
two.

05:06.884 --> 05:09.102
Which is equal to 8.5.

05:09.102 --> 05:12.086
So the slope of this
green line here is 8.5.

05:12.086 --> 05:13.545
And that would be our best estimate

05:13.545 --> 05:16.452
